The files under inventory/, the message catalog under
crates/rpsh-messages/src/, and the files named *.golden under
tests/conformance/ are generated from the latest stable PowerShell release
installed by scripts/fetch-pwsh.sh. The exact version is recorded in the
generated header or in tests/conformance/reference.txt.
bench/assets/compiler.test.ps1 is copied from the upstream test suite.

The ICU tailoring in crates/rpsh-runtime/src/culture/ignore_case.rules and
the collation-element prefix and suffix matches in that directory follow the
width and kana tables and affix comparisons in .NET 11.0.0's pal_collation.c.
The search-new.rules and search-old.rules files reproduce its grapheme
boundaries for culture-sensitive string searches.
The full ordering of equal Sort-Object keys follows the same release's
ArraySortHelper. Unicode casing, normalization validation and ICU time
patterns follow pal_casing.c, Normalization.Icu.cs and CultureData.Icu.cs.
The bounded heap follows PowerShell's Sort-Object.cs.

